ind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo v1.0.0 Patch","summary":"This update brings further improvements to editor localization and drag-and-drop reordering.ChangesImproved localized text in the editor.Refined drag-and-drop reordering of editor entries.Thank you for playing the demo and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-11T08:00:26Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846018067937974","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4698390-1845383656388283","game_id":"steam-4698390","kind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo v0.9.8 Patch","summary":"This update brings extensive reworks to souvenirs, traits, and tag effects, alongside fixes for multiple UI issues.ChangesReworked numerous souvenirs and their effects.Reworked a range of traits and their effects.Updated many tag effects.Fixed multiple UI bugs.Thank you for playing the demo and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-03T03:19:49Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656388283","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4698390-1842846814445902","game_id":"steam-4698390","kind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo v0.9.2 Patch","summary":"This update expands the comment system while improving game balance and the overall interface experience.ChangesImplemented the new comment interaction feature.Players can now interact with comments in the game.Adjusted several gameplay values to improve overall balance.Fixed multiple UI display and interaction issues.Fixed additional reported issues.Thank you for playing the demo and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T09:48:54Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445902","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4698390-1842846814445897","game_id":"steam-4698390","kind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo v0.9.0 Patch","summary":"This update introduces a new meta-progression system and further improves the stability and usability of the game interface.ChangesIntroduced the new meta-progression system.Players can now gain persistent progression beyond individual runs.Fixed multiple UI display issues.Fixed several interface interaction problems.Fixed additional reported issues.Thank you for playing the demo and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-04T09:46:13Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842846814445897","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4698390-1842212951310364","game_id":"steam-4698390","kind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo v0.9.1 Patch","summary":"This update focuses on improving tag-related interactions and the overall interface experience.ChangesImproved how tags are displayed when recommending content.Improved how tags are displayed during tag placement.Added drag-and-drop tag reordering.Fixed multiple UI display and interaction issues.Fixed additional reported issues.Thank you for playing the demo and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-31T14:22:33Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1842212951310364","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4698390-1841579228678722","game_id":"steam-4698390","kind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo v0.8.95 Patch","summary":"This update focuses on improving UI stability and making gameplay information easier to understand.ChangesFixed multiple UI display issues.Fixed several interface interaction problems.Added tooltips to various buttons and interface elements.Improved the presentation and descriptions of certain information.Fixed several other reported issues.Thank you for playing the demo and sharing your feedback!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-25T15:50:30Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228678722","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4698390-1841579228675900","game_id":"steam-4698390","kind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo v0.8.9 Patch","summary":"Thank you to everyone who has played the Feedmaster Demo and shared feedback with me.This patch introduces new controls to make the game flow more convenient, along with performance improvements, interface refinements, and several bug fixes.New FeaturesAdded a visible speed-up button.Added an End Week Now button, allowing players to immediately proceed to the weekly settlement after finishing their actions.ImprovementsImproved overall game performance.Refined the detail panels to make informatio","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-24T15:53:48Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228675900","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4698390-1841579228672944","game_id":"steam-4698390","kind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo Update – Tutorial Rework","summary":"Thank you to everyone who played the Feedmaster Demo and shared feedback with me.Based on your suggestions, I have completely reworked the tutorial level. The new tutorial provides clearer instructions, improves the pacing of the introduction, and makes it easier to understand Feedmaster's core mechanics.ChangesReworked the tutorial level based on Demo player feedback.Improved the instructions for key gameplay mechanics.Adjusted the pacing and flow of the tutorial.Fixed bugs affecting the settle","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-23T08:48:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228672944","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4698390-1841579228664734","game_id":"steam-4698390","kind":"update","title":"Feedmaster Demo v0.8.6 Patch","summary":"This update includes several improvements to progression, recommendation feedback, localization, and audio feedback.ChangesReduced the Satisfaction and Follower requirements for Creator and Company level-ups.Added a display showing the match rate between each User and Content.Corrected several translation and localization issues.Added a warning when Content cannot be recommended.Added a sound effect when removing a registered User.ImprovementsImproved feedback when recommendation conditions are ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-08-20T08:15:10Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1841579228664734","verified_at":"2026-10-20T16:18:15Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4698390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:16Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:16Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4698390":"2026-10-26T13:38:16Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4698390":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:16Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T13:38:16Z","status":"ok","error_c